      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Preparation",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-0-0",
              "text": "Cook the lentils according to the package directions. Drain, rinse and leave to cool.",
              "ingredientUses": [
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-4"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "step-0-1",
              "text": "Meanwhile, make the vinaigrette: in a small bowl, whisk the juice and zest of half a lemon with the olive oil, garlic, oregano, salt and pepper. Set aside.",
              "ingredientUses": [
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-0"
                },
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-1"
                },
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-2"
                },
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-3"
                },
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-9"
                },
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-10"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "step-0-2",
              "text": "Cut the cherry tomatoes into very small pieces. In a salad bowl, combine them with the lentils, parsley, red onion and feta. Add the vinaigrette and toss gently.",
              "ingredientUses": [
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-4"
                },
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-5"
                },
                {
                  "ingredientId": "ingredient-main-6"
                },
                {
